<title>USA: Rochester Gas Q1 shr $1.02 vs $1.05.</title>
<headline>Rochester Gas Q1 shr $1.02 vs $1.05.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOR THE PERIODS ENDED MARCH 30</p>
<p> 3 MONTHS					   1997	    1996</p>
<p> OPERATING REVENUES		    $314,845,000  $309,195,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME				  41,433,000    42,489,000</p>
<p>EARNINGS APPLICABLE TO COMMON STOCK</p>
<p>						 39,729,000    40,623,000</p>
<p> AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING	    38,851,000    38,577,000</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE				1.02	    1.05</p>
<p> 12 MONTHS					  1997	   1996*</p>
<p> OPERATING REVENUES		  1,059,697,000  1,044,137,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME				  96,455,000    83,898,000</p>
<p>EARNINGS APPLICABLE TO COMMON STOCK</p>
<p>						 89,152,000    76,433,000</p>
<p> AVERAGE SHARES OUTSTANDING	    38,830,000    38,305,000</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE				2.29	    1.99</p>
<p>NOTE: * Earnings for the twelve month period ending March 30, 1996 were reduced by $0.46 due to writeoffs associated with certain gas pipeline capacity issues.</p>
